   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2022-08-03",
   "text": "Restore Protections for Dialysis Patients Act\n This bill specifies that private health insurers may not limit, restrict, or condition benefits for renal dialysis services for individuals with end-stage renal disease as compared to other types of benefits for other medical conditions under Medicare secondary payer rules."
  }
